Satoshi
=======

Designed by Deni Anggara for the Indian Type Foundry (ITF).
Distributed on Fontshare: https://www.fontshare.com/fonts/satoshi
Licence: ITF Free Font License, as Fontshare lists it for this family.

The files in this directory are the Light (300), Regular (400), Medium (500)
and Bold (700) WOFF2 files that Fontshare's CSS API serves for web use. They
are declared with @font-face in src/console/styles/themes/molior.css.

Satoshi has no 600 weight. A request for semibold is answered by Bold.
